  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The short answer",
      "items": [
        "A config module reads the environment once",
        "DATA_DRIVER picks the Prisma or memory adapter, ATTACHMENT_STORAGE and a connection string pick the blob adapter, and Docker or Vercel only supply the environment",
        "Redis is provisioned but unused"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not shown here",
      "items": [
        "The CI workflow (install, generate Prisma client, agent-tools check, typecheck, lint, tests, audit, build) and the production environment check scripts",
        "Connected but out of scope: Auth.js sessions, Context and guards, API key service, REST API /api/v1, Channel adapters, Unified intake"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Constraints",
      "items": [
        "Only the DataStore port and the database blob store reach the Prisma adapter: services depend on the port so persistence swaps with one environment variable; the one recorded exception is databaseBlob.ts, which imports the Prisma client directly"
      ]
    }
  ]
